{"a":[55,55],"h":"<p>55.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"74\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 74.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 24.0 24.0 30.8 30.8 44.3 51.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"51.0 57.8\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> O halde sabret - müşriklerin ezalarına tehammül ederek sebat et<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"153\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 153.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 27.0 48.0 48.0 54.7 54.7 54.7 61.4 69.0 84.7 93.7 93.7 102.7 120.0 120.0 130.4 130.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"27.0 84.7 102.7 120.0 137.2\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> çünkü Allahın va'di haktır, nusratı muhakkak olacaktır, onun için sabret<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"142\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 142.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 33.0 33.0 39.8 39.8 46.6 55.6 55.6 72.0 72.0 79.6 79.6 86.3 86.3 93.0 99.8 111.0 117.8\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 46.6 93.0 99.8 117.8 126.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve zenbine istiğfar eyle - tedarük edemediğin eksiklikleri örtmesi için rabbının mağrifetini iste<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"158\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 158.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 33.0 33.0 33.0 39.7 57.0 57.0 66.0 66.0 75.0 87.7 87.7 103.4 103.4 115.4 115.4 115.4 133.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 39.7 75.0 122.2 122.2 133.4 141.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve rabbının hamdiyle tesbih et<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"154\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 153.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 24.7 31.4 43.4 43.4 50.3 50.3 54.7 62.3 69.0 86.3 86.3 86.3 97.4 97.4 109.4 116.3 116.3 123.7 130.4 130.4\" y=\"25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"31.4 69.0 109.4 137.3\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> akşam ve sabah - bu ta'bir her vakıt demek gibi devam ifâde eder. Allaha hamd-ü şükrederek tenzîhe devam et, ne lisan, ne kalb, hiç zikirden gafil olmasın demek olur.</p><p>56. </p>"}